# Changelog
## [0.2.0] - 2026-10-28
### Breaking changes
 - `ErrorKind` and `YamlPosition` now implement `FromStr` instead of
   `TryFrom<&str>`. (3096b38)
 - `parser`: Reject raw non-printable characters. This adds the
   `ErrorKind::InvalidCharacter` variant; because `ErrorKind` is not
   `#[non_exhaustive]`, exhaustive matches in downstream code must be
   updated. (6929013)

### New features
 - N/A

### Bug fixes
 - deserializer: Handle ValueData::Null in deserialize_any. (e2b5e4d)
 - parser: Enforce quoted-scalar continuation indentation for single quotes. (b23e2e9)
 - parser: End flow plain scalars at ':' before '[' or '{'. (8b045c7)
 - parser: Accept trailing white space after a document end marker. (f7064f9)
 - parser: Recognize document start markers only at column 0. (f16bb6d)
 - parser: Reject indented directives. (8d078de)
 - parser: Reject a zero block-scalar indentation indicator after chomping. (7326953)
 - parser: Allow a trailing comment on %TAG directive lines. (bb6bad9)
 - parser: Reject %YAML directives with an unsupported major version. (33c50d7)
 - parser: Reject node properties on block aliases. (616efe3)
 - parser: Ignore inline comments when detecting block structure. (6858281)
 - parser: Fix plain-scalar first-character checks with indentation. (d836c80)
 - value: Fix integer/float Core Schema resolution. (449e086)
 - serializer: Escape astral characters with \U instead of \u. (9a3c8af)
 - serializer: Fix lossy folding of long scalars and max_width 0. (a56c122)
 - parser: Accept tab separation in block scalar headers. (1f89fd8)
 - parser: Require an explicit document start after directives. (2bbfef0)
 - parser: Validate reserved directive names and tag handles. (52ad0da)
 - parser: Validate tag shorthand suffixes. (9d2e785)
 - parser: Treat tabs as separation in flow plain scalars. (cdc5e06)
 - parser: End root block scalars at a document start marker. (54639cc)
 - parser: Only reject column-0 document markers inside flow collections. (99bdab5)
 - parser: Do not consume a flow indicator as anchor separation. (1f6b2c0)
 - parser: Reject document marker tokens with trailing content. (cf2045f)
 - serializer: Preserve content line breaks in single-quoted dumps. (d5d3779)
 - serializer: Escape a leading byte order mark. (b5c4f68)
 - parser: Validate %TAG directive prefixes. (df61757)
 - parser: Validate verbatim tags. (cd3bc24)
 - parser: Treat ':\t' as a mapping separator in plain-scalar lookahead. (4c0de84)
 - parser: Require separation after a verbatim tag. (fa4718d)
 - serializer: Fix nested folded scalar indentation. (80e632e)

## [0.1.1] - 2026-09-21
### Breaking changes
 - N/A

### New features
 - N/A

### Bug fixes
 - parser: Recognize document markers only at column 0. (7be4263)
 - parser: Attach explicit-key properties to the compact key node. (5e8eaff)
 - value: preserve resolved tags in serde Value path. (7c6d52a)
 - parser: Keep a lone explicit-key `?` from swallowing the value line. (fe8c807)
 - parser: Enforce the 1024-character implicit key limit. (3f826e6)
 - parser: Normalize CR/CRLF line breaks in scalars. (516079c)
 - parser: Fix explicit-key edge cases for block mappings. (a62cab8)
 - parser: Stop a comment after `key: ` from swallowing the next node. (b75432b)
 - parser: Reject bare `,` at flow mapping entry start. (ecfb967)
 - deserializer: Resolve type-forcing tags for concrete target types. (d1fd631)
 - value: Treat repeated-sign float words as invalid numbers. (a892ffe)
 - value: Restore radix-specific `as_i64` error messages. (c65e08c)
 - serializer: Keep -0.0 a float when serializing. (9f7d080)
 - serializer: Quote strings with a trailing blank so they round-trip. (1931d86)
 - parser: Strip a leading UTF-8 BOM so it does not corrupt the first token. (66aa086)
 - value: Reject null / bool / number scalars in `as_char`. (6ed0b1b)
 - value: Accept all six YAML 1.2 Core Schema boolean spellings. (bccf2ba)
 - serializer: Render non-finite floats as .inf / -.inf / .nan. (654bae0)
 - value: Fix as_i64() rejecting i64::MIN in every radix. (3f0c6b6)
 - value: Don't classify bare inf/nan/infinity words as YAML floats. (e4e319c)
 - compose: reject near-limit alias expansion bombs. (0a80d73)

